      "updated": 1782939863879,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "源码参考\nruntime/malloc.go：mallocgc、tiny allocator、size class\nruntime/mheap.go：mheap、arena、span、page\nruntime/mcache.go：每个 P 的 mcache\nruntime/stack.go：stack growth、stack copy\nruntime/mgc.go：mark、sweep、GC roots",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rectangle_00251",
      "originalText": "源码参考\nruntime/malloc.go：mallocgc、tiny allocator、size class\nruntime/mheap.go：mheap、arena、span、page\nruntime/mcache.go：每个 P 的 mcache\nruntime/stack.go：stack growth、stack copy\nruntime/mgc.go：mark、sweep、GC roots",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
