      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "group_00561"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 54708,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1296584348,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782939863881,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "核心结论\n1. Go 堆分配入口是 mallocgc()\n2. 非逃逸对象可以放在 Goroutine Stack\n3. 逃逸对象进入 Heap，由 GC 管理\n4. Tiny Object：<16B 且无指针，多个对象共享 tiny block\n5. Small Object：16B~32KB，按 size class 经 mcache 分配\n6. Large Object：>32KB，直接从 mheap 申请 span",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rectangle_00562",
      "originalText": "核心结论\n1. Go 堆分配入口是 mallocgc()\n2. 非逃逸对象可以放在 Goroutine Stack\n3. 逃逸对象进入 Heap，由 GC 管理\n4. Tiny Object：<16B 且无指针，多个对象共享 tiny block\n5. Small Object：16B~32KB，按 size class 经 mcache 分配\n6. Large Object：>32KB，直接从 mheap 申请 span",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 133,
      "index": "b5i"
    },
    {
      "id": "rectangle_00565",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 3360,
      "y": 1360,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1.25,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "group_00564"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 54902,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1159624996,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "text_00566",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1782939863881,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b5j"
    },
    {
      "id": "text_00566",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3374,
      "y": 1370,
      "width": 712,
      "height": 122,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#111111",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "group_00564"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 54999,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 2096896796,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782939863881,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Allocator 层级\nP → mcache：本地缓存，无需加锁\nmcentral：所有 P 共享，需要锁，按 size class 管理 span\nmheap：整个 Runtime 唯一，管理 arena / span / page\nOS mmap：必要时向内核申请虚拟内存",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rectangle_00565",
      "originalText": "Allocator 层级\nP → mcache：本地缓存，无需加锁\nmcentral：所有 P 共享，需要锁，按 size class 管理 span\nmheap：整个 Runtime 唯一，管理 arena / span / page\nOS mmap：必要时向内核申请虚拟内存",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 95,
      "index": "b5k"
    },
    {
      "id": "rectangle_00568",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 3360,
      "y": 1645,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1.25,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "group_00567"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 55193,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1958458532,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "text_00569",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1782939863881,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b5l"
    },
    {
      "id": "text_00569",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3374,
      "y": 1655,
      "width": 712,
      "height": 146,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#111111",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "group_00567"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 55290,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 226645916,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782939863881,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Heap 层级\nArena：64MB\nSpan：连续若干 Page\nPage：8KB\nObject：真正存放 Go 对象\nspan metadata 让 Runtime 知道对象大小、指针位图、是否可扫",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rectangle_00568",
      "originalText": "Heap 层级\nArena：64MB\nSpan：连续若干 Page\nPage：8KB\nObject：真正存放 Go 对象\nspan metadata 让 Runtime 知道对象大小、指针位图、是否可扫",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 114,
      "index": "b5m"
    },
    {
      "id": "rectangle_00571",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 3360,
      "y": 1930,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1.25,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "group_00570"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 55484,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1143308324,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "text_00572",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1782939863881,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b5n"
    },
    {
      "id": "text_00572",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3374,
      "y": 1940,
      "width": 712,
      "height": 122,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#111111",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "group_00570"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 55581,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 453837852,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782939863881,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GC 关系\nGC Root 来自栈、全局变量、寄存器和 Runtime 结构\nMark 从 Root 出发标记可达对象\nWhite 对象若不可达会在 Sweep 阶段释放\nFree Span / object 回到 Allocator 供再次分配",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rectangle_00571",
      "originalText": "GC 关系\nGC Root 来自栈、全局变量、寄存器和 Runtime 结构\nMark 从 Root 出发标记可达对象\nWhite 对象若不可达会在 Sweep 阶段释放\nFree Span / object 回到 Allocator 供再次分配",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 95,
      "index": "b5o"
    },
    {
      "id": "rectangle_00574",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 3360,
      "y": 2215,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1.25,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "group_00573"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 55775,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 726260644,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "text_00575",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1782939863881,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b5p"
    },
    {
      "id": "text_00575",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3374,
      "y": 2225,
      "width": 712,
      "height": 122,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#111111",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "group_00573"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 55872,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1804476572,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782939863881,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Stack 关系\n每个 G 有自己的 Stack，初始约 2KB\n栈增长通过 stack growth / stack copy 实现\n栈上对象无需 GC 逐个释放，函数返回即可回收栈帧\n栈中指针可能成为 GC Root 指向 Heap Object",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rectangle_00574",
      "originalText": "Stack 关系\n每个 G 有自己的 Stack，初始约 2KB\n栈增长通过 stack growth / stack copy 实现\n栈上对象无需 GC 逐个释放，函数返回即可回收栈帧\n栈中指针可能成为 GC Root 指向 Heap Object",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 95,
      "index": "b5q"
    },
    {
      "id": "rectangle_00577",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 3358.69687993964,
      "y": 2497.393759879279,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1.25,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "group_00576"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 56066,
      "version": 15,
      "versionNonce": 1841312164,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "text_00578",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1783986098715,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b5r"
    },
    {
      "id": "text_00578",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3363.69687993964,
      "y": 2502.393759879279,
      "width": 712,
      "height": 118.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#111111",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "group_00576"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 56163,
      "version": 18,
      "versionNonce": 26369316,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783986098715,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "注意\nSTW 不是每次分配都会发生；图中红色用于提醒 stack copy、GC 协调等可能影响调度\n的 Runtime 行为。\n读源码时从 mallocgc() → mcache.nextFree() → mcentral.cacheSpan() →\nmheap.alloc() 串起来。",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rectangle_00577",
      "originalText": "注意\nSTW 不是每次分配都会发生；图中红色用于提醒 stack copy、GC 协调等可能影响调度的 Runtime 行为。\n读源码时从 mallocgc() → mcache.nextFree() → mcentral.cacheSpan() → mheap.alloc() 串起来。",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 57,
      "index": "b5s"
    },
    {
      "id": "rectangle_00580",
